  "question": {
    "text": "If $1, \\omega, \\omega^2$ are the cube roots of unity, then $\\Delta=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & \\omega^n & \\omega^{2 n} \\\\ \\omega^n & \\omega^{2 n} & 1 \\\\ \\omega^{2 n} & 1 & \\omega^n\\end{array}\\right|$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "wVsTn",
      "text": "\n$\\omega^2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "zNb54",
      "text": "\n0\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "IuZ1g",
      "text": "\n1\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pNmZc",
      "text": "\n$\\omega$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Applying $\\mathrm{R}_1 \\rightarrow \\mathrm{R}_1+\\mathrm{R}_2+\\mathrm{R}_3$\nAs, $1+\\omega^{\\mathrm{n}}+\\omega^{2 \\mathrm{n}}=0 ; \\quad \\therefore \\Delta=0$",
    "image": null
  },
